# ================= FORMULA =================
h1('The 6-Part Thumbnail Formula')
para("You'll see this same thumbnail on almost every video he's put out recently:")
img('formula_pair.jpg', 6.5)
para("These two thumbnails went out five months apart. The only thing we changed was the chart. Here are the six parts, and we don't break the rules:")
bullets(['A black background with a faint chart grid',
         'Red and green candlesticks with white wicks, taken from a real chart',
         'One entry marker and one exit marker, and nothing else marked',
         'RP cut out on one side, in a grey crew neck, with a calm face',
         'One line of heavy white text',
         'One coloured box with 2 or 3 words inside it'], numbered=True)
h2('What Each Part Does')
para('The black background makes it pop. YouTube is bright and busy, so a dark thumbnail stands out next to everything else.')
para("The real candlesticks tell a trader \"this is for you\" in a split second. Most people won't care about a chart, and that's fine. Those people were never going to buy anyway.")
para('The entry and exit markers show the result but hide how he got it. That gap is the reason people click.')
para("The calm face says \"I know what I'm doing.\" A shocked face would say the opposite. And because it's the same face, in the same shirt, every time, his face becomes the brand.")
para("The text is 5 words or fewer, and it never repeats the title. It adds something the title doesn't say. For example:")
para('Thumbnail: *"It\'s so f{AST}cking simple."*', blank_after=False)
para('Title: *"I Made $750,000 In A Year With This Super Easy Scalping Strategy"*')
para("The title makes the promise and the thumbnail gives the feeling. Here's the same idea from a cooking channel:")
img('additive.jpg', 4.5, caption='(The title says "Teriyaki Chicken Meal Prep". The thumbnail says "Better than Panda".)')
para('The coloured box gives the eye one place to land. When everything is shouting, nothing gets read.')
para("If you only remember one rule from this section, make it this one: keep it to three things. RP's thumbnail has a face, a chart and one line of text. That's it. Anything else just makes it harder to read on a phone.")
para('As I like to say, creating thumbnails is not an art. **It\'s engineering.**')

