# ================= BUILD =================
h1('How To Build Your Thumbnail Formula (Step By Step)')
h2('Step 1: Fill In The Template')
para("Start with RP's layout: your face on one side, your buyer's world on the other, and one line of text on top. Fill in the last column for your business.")
table([['Part', 'RP Profits', 'Example: a sales consultant', 'Yours'],
       ['Background', 'Black, faint chart grid', 'Dark grey, faint calendar grid', ''],
       ['What the buyer looks at', 'Real candlesticks', 'A calendar full of booked calls', ''],
       ['The result, marked', 'One entry, one exit', 'One empty week, one full week', ''],
       ['You, the same every time', 'Calm face, grey crew neck', 'Calm face, navy t-shirt', ''],
       ['One line of text', 'Heavy, white, sans-serif', 'Heavy, white, sans-serif', ''],
       ['One coloured box', '"simple." in red', '"40 calls" in green', '']], [1.6, 1.6, 1.9, 1.4])
para("Then pick one brand colour and one bold sans-serif font (something like Montserrat or Roboto), and use them forever. Serif fonts are harder to read at phone size, so skip them.")
h2('Step 2: Take Your Face Photos Once')
para("This takes about 20 minutes, and you'll use these photos for a year. A lot of you are going to feel super goofy taking them. Trust me, it's essential to take these pictures at least once.")
para("Use your iPhone in 4K. Take real photos, not screenshots from a video and never a webcam, because video frames are always lower quality. Keep coloured lights off your face, look straight into the lens, and frame from the shoulders up so you can crop in later. Wear the same top every time.")
img('shoulders.jpg', 4.5, caption='(Shoulders up, looking into the lens, plain background.)')
para('Start with one expression: calm, like RP. Once that\'s working, add a few more so you have the right face for the right video:')
img('expressions.jpg', 6.5)
table([['Expression', 'Use it for'],
       ['Calm (start here)', 'How-to videos, authority, serious topics'],
       ['Smiling', 'Wins, success stories, "here\'s what I learned"'],
       ['Shocked', 'A result that\'s genuinely surprising'],
       ['Angry', 'Mistakes, "don\'t do this", strong opinions']], [2.0, 4.5])
para('Take 20 or more shots of each, and save them all in one folder so you never have to go hunting for them.')
h2('Step 3: Make Your Master Thumbnail')
para("There are two ways to do this.")
para("If you use Canva, build it once. Then for every new video, duplicate it and change only two things: the picture of your buyer's world, and the 2 or 3 words in the box. That takes about 10 minutes.")
para('If you want to use AI, Subscribr does this. Upload your face and a reference thumbnail with the layout you want, and generate it. Use AI Feedback to clean it up, then save the winner as your reference for every thumbnail after that.')
img('subscribr.jpg', 4.5)
para('Here\'s a prompt you can copy:')
para('*"Turn this into a premium YouTube thumbnail. Keep the layout. Use brand colour [your hex code]. Change the font to [your font] Bold. Use the person from [reference image]."*')
h2('Step 4: Run 3 Checks Before You Upload')
bullets(['Shrink it to phone size and check you can still read everything.',
         'Put it next to 5 thumbnails from your competitors and see if it stands out or blends in.',
         'Show it to a friend for 2 seconds and ask them what the video is about.'], numbered=True)
img('mobile.jpg', 6.5, caption='(This is the size most people will see your thumbnail.)')
para("If it fails any of these, it's usually one of three things: colours that don't contrast, a face that's too small, or too many words.")

